to each other for a little over a week.

250
00:13:29,354 --> 00:13:32,354
Which made school not the
least bit awkward, is it?

251
00:13:32,774 --> 00:13:37,351
All that, and I still lost my summer
vacation to make up tests and extra lessons.

252
00:13:37,434 --> 00:13:38,264
Darn it!

253
00:13:38,347 --> 00:13:41,131
Now I'm really on my own and
I still don't have a plan!

254
00:13:41,214 --> 00:13:42,694
What am I going to do?

255
00:13:44,934 --> 00:13:45,764
That's right!

256
00:13:46,054 --> 00:13:49,451
All I need to do is charm them and
they'll turn against each other!

257
00:13:49,534 --> 00:13:52,005
I just have to get this thing off my head!

258
00:13:54,514 --> 00:13:55,591
Get off of me!

259
00:13:55,674 --> 00:13:56,791
What are you doing?

260
00:13:56,874 --> 00:13:58,234
Stop shaking the cage!

261
00:13:59,834 --> 00:14:00,664
Jake!

262
00:14:06,274 --> 00:14:08,594
Hey, who forgot to lock the cage?

263
00:14:08,974 --> 00:14:10,314
Sorry, that was me.

264
00:14:12,074 --> 00:14:13,534
So, she all right?

265
00:14:14,234 --> 00:14:15,587
Are you even listening?

266
00:14:16,314 --> 00:14:17,874
It's a goddess.

267
00:14:25,414 --> 00:14:27,471
I didn't think it'd put
up this big of a fight.

268
00:14:27,554 --> 00:14:30,354
You said you had a plan,
didn't you? Somewhat.

269
00:14:30,514 --> 00:14:32,591
I assumed I could just
yank it out of the lake.

270
00:14:32,674 --> 00:14:34,203
Why would you assume that?

271
00:14:35,654 --> 00:14:36,484
What's wrong?

272
00:14:36,734 --> 00:14:38,391
Why is my strength failing me?

273
00:14:38,474 --> 00:14:40,431
My diet is still perfectly balanced.

274
00:14:40,514 --> 00:14:41,971
I keep up with my morning routine.

275
00:14:42,054 --> 00:14:44,991
I see no reason why I should
be struggling with this.

276
00:14:45,074 --> 00:14:46,754
So why is everything off?

277
00:14:46,874 --> 00:14:47,714
There she is.

278
00:14:48,274 --> 00:14:49,104
Kill her!

279
00:14:49,734 --> 00:14:50,616
Bring her down!

280
00:14:51,034 --> 00:14:52,994
Please, settle down! What?

281
00:14:53,194 --> 00:14:54,076
There's a moth?

282
00:14:54,734 --> 00:14:55,564
Hey!

283
00:14:55,647 --> 00:14:56,477
Tachibana!

284
00:14:56,560 --> 00:14:58,031
She's nothing but a witch!

285
00:14:58,114 --> 00:15:00,411
That tart tried to steal
my husband from me!

286
00:15:00,494 --> 00:15:01,324
Goddess!

287
00:15:01,407 --> 00:15:03,211
I want at least three children with you!

288
00:15:03,294 --> 00:15:04,124
Pick me!

289
00:15:04,207 --> 00:15:05,037
I want at least four!

290
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:05,950
Now, hold on!

291
00:15:06,033 --> 00:15:09,110
This girl is meant to be an
offering to the squid gun!

292
00:15:10,434 --> 00:15:11,264
God!

293
00:15:11,347 --> 00:15:12,177
Seriously!

294
00:15:12,260 --> 00:15:13,711
Why does the worst stuff
always have to happen to me?

295
00:15:13,794 --> 00:15:16,711
Enough with this self-pity
already, you home-wrecking tramp!

296
00:15:16,794 --> 00:15:18,931
Those crocodile tears
may work on our husbands,

297
00:15:19,014 --> 00:15:20,831
but they won't have any effect on us!

298
00:15:20,914 --> 00:15:23,511
I bet you've never done an
honest day's work in your life!

299
00:15:23,594 --> 00:15:25,694
Beauty is such a burden, isn't it?

300
00:15:25,834 --> 00:15:29,111
Your existence is reason enough
for us to burn you at the stake!

301
00:15:29,194 --> 00:15:30,914
Hear, hear! Oh, yeah?

302
00:15:31,354 --> 00:15:32,214
Well, sorry!

303
00:15:32,574 --> 00:15:34,692
Cause there's no way I'm dying here!

304
00:15:34,874 --> 00:15:36,534
And how dare you judge me?

305
00:15:36,634 --> 00:15:37,831
I haven't done anything!

306
00:15:37,914 --> 00:15:41,154
While you guys do human
sacrifice and for what? Squid?

307
00:15:41,374 --> 00:15:43,171
You're a bunch of idiot murderers!

308
00:15:43,254 --> 00:15:45,491
How dare you badmouth
our precious village!

309
00:15:45,574 --> 00:15:46,404
See?

310
00:15:46,487 --> 00:15:47,317
She is a witch!

311
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:48,230
She's cursing us!

312
00:15:48,313 --> 00:15:50,931
Don't tell me that girl on
the tower is your companion!

313
00:15:51,014 --> 00:15:51,844
That's right.

314
00:15:51,927 --> 00:15:54,631
You actually think I'm like
this because I want to be?

315
00:15:54,714 --> 00:15:57,531
It's easy to judge people by
their looks or your opinions.

316
00:15:57,614 --> 00:16:01,631
You stand there randomly deciding what a
prison's worth and why, because it's fun?

317
00:16:01,714 --> 00:16:03,474
I am not the problem here!

318
00:16:03,614 --> 00:16:05,471
So don't put your baggage on me!

319
00:16:05,554 --> 00:16:07,031
Like, what human sacrifice?

320
00:16:07,114 --> 00:16:09,691
Why not just make it a
life-size doll and give it that?

321
00:16:09,774 --> 00:16:12,068
Not very shy with her opinions, is she?

322
00:16:12,334 --> 00:16:13,174
Of course not.

323
00:16:13,794 --> 00:16:15,559
Never has been, never will be.

324
00:16:18,174 --> 00:16:19,004
Dr.

325
00:16:19,087 --> 00:16:19,917
Yubana, you okay?

326
00:16:20,000 --> 00:16:21,534
Take a guess!

327
00:16:21,754 --> 00:16:24,011
I'm seconds away from being slaughtered!

328
00:16:24,094 --> 00:16:25,414
I'm on my way now!

329
00:16:25,654 --> 00:16:27,536
I can't hold on for much longer!

330
00:16:28,314 --> 00:16:30,351
Please, hurry up and get over here!

331
00:16:30,434 --> 00:16:33,531
And do something about this
angry mob before they belay me!

332
00:16:33,614 --> 00:16:34,444
Of course!

333
00:16:44,674 --> 00:16:45,634
Oh, wow!

334
00:16:51,034 --> 00:16:51,974
Take this!

335
00:16:59,974 --> 00:17:01,014
Fake girl!

336
00:17:02,814 --> 00:17:04,311
Do you think she's alright?

337
00:17:04,394 --> 00:17:06,711
I'm not sure how long an
elf could survive in there.

338
00:17:06,794 --> 00:17:08,631
She's tougher than she seems to be.

339
00:17:08,714 --> 00:17:09,814
She'll be fine.

340
00:17:10,134 --> 00:17:12,491
Don't abandon your
responsibility like that!

341
00:17:12,574 --> 00:17:14,339
She's in there because of you!

342
00:17:14,594 --> 00:17:16,834
But why, great squid god?

343
00:17:17,174 --> 00:17:18,611
Why did you do that?

344
00:17:18,694 --> 00:17:22,974
I always minding my own business
since you're in a womanly snag.

345
00:17:23,174 --> 00:17:27,586
And then all of a sudden, I'm per -
Serves you right, you pervy cephalopod!

346
00:17:28,354 --> 00:17:30,354
Oh, well, hello there.

347
00:17:30,614 --> 00:17:32,431
You're quite the cutie, aren't you?

348
00:17:32,514 --> 00:17:35,334
Uh, don't even think
about it, Slimeball. Cute!

349
00:17:39,554 --> 00:17:41,194
I'm gonna eat you up!

350
00:17:47,854 --> 00:17:49,894
Hold on, I'm almost there!

351
00:17:50,594 --> 00:17:52,594
Almost is not cutting it!

352
00:17:55,774 --> 00:17:56,874
Oh, you.

353
00:17:57,474 --> 00:17:59,650
At long last, I will see your demise!

354
00:17:59,814 --> 00:18:01,520
Come and let us die together!

355
00:18:02,094 --> 00:18:02,924
Stop it!

356
00:18:03,074 --> 00:18:04,294
Stop it, you weirdo!

357
00:18:04,514 --> 00:18:07,791
Quit trying to get us killed and
finish off this creepy squid!

358
00:18:07,874 --> 00:18:08,871
What did you say?

359
00:18:08,954 --> 00:18:11,154
Premier, use this!

360
00:18:13,134 --> 00:18:14,514
I see.

361
00:18:30,034 --> 00:18:32,374
It was so cold!

362
00:18:36,334 --> 00:18:40,687
I knew that Damascus knife was sharp,
but what you did was something else.

363
00:18:43,394 --> 00:18:45,794
Oh, uh, thank you for saving me, okay?

364
00:18:54,514 --> 00:18:56,494
The pain is unbearable!

365
00:18:58,214 --> 00:18:59,654
It's cruel, queen!

366
00:19:03,194 --> 00:19:04,354
Mmm. Tasty!

367
00:19:05,214 --> 00:19:06,914
Hey, I saw that look.

368
00:19:07,134 --> 00:19:09,991
There's plenty to go around,
so stop ogling my piece.

369
00:19:10,074 --> 00:19:13,431
No, it's just you're eating our god, so...

370
00:19:13,514 --> 00:19:15,455
You think a god tastes this good?

371
00:19:15,574 --> 00:19:18,398
This is nothing more than
delicious giant squid!

372
00:19:19,574 --> 00:19:20,994
No, it can't be.

373
00:19:24,934 --> 00:19:25,764
Heatery.

374
00:19:26,014 --> 00:19:28,434
Miggy, it seems we've been beaten.

375
00:19:31,794 --> 00:19:37,474
My good people, I ask you, is it right to
sacrifice a life to appease a giant squid?

376
00:19:37,874 --> 00:19:42,094
I see now that we were wrong, for
we are not squids, we are human!

377
00:19:43,894 --> 00:19:45,514
Let's never come back here.

378
00:19:46,394 --> 00:19:51,294
And I think we're all in agreement that
this elf shall be our next village head.

379
00:19:52,834 --> 00:19:54,354
Oh, hey, I leveled up.

380
00:19:55,294 --> 00:19:56,706
Hey there, good evening.

381
00:19:57,514 --> 00:19:59,794
Well, you sure adopted quickly.

382
00:20:00,254 --> 00:20:01,614
Is that a good thing?

383
00:20:02,374 --> 00:20:03,694
Everyone seems happy.

384
00:20:03,954 --> 00:20:05,248
I think that's enough.

385
00:20:08,214 --> 00:20:09,674
Hey, so... Huh?

386
00:20:10,934 --> 00:20:12,014
I apologize.

387
00:20:12,634 --> 00:20:13,694
For what?

388
00:20:14,074 --> 00:20:15,133
For your notebook.

389
00:20:15,914 --> 00:20:18,714
Oh my gosh, I completely
forgot about that!

390
00:20:19,254 --> 00:20:21,489
Don't worry about it, I'm over it now.

391
00:20:22,174 --> 00:20:25,551
Honestly, I'm more surprised that you
had something to be embarrassed about.

392
00:20:25,634 --> 00:20:27,691
I guess you're sort of human after all.

393
00:20:27,774 --> 00:20:28,614
Only sort of?

394
00:20:29,414 --> 00:20:33,031
I'm still curious what it was that
you just had to keep me from seeing.

395
00:20:33,114 --> 00:20:35,471
There's no getting back the
info you scribbled over.

396
00:20:35,554 --> 00:20:39,651
Eh, maybe you can show me your own
notebook once we get back to our world.

397
00:20:39,734 --> 00:20:41,574
Sorry, I don't have it anymore.

398
00:20:42,354 --> 00:20:44,707
My grandmother threw it out a while ago.

399
00:20:48,214 --> 00:20:49,051
Oh, gotcha.

400
00:20:49,134 --> 00:20:51,154
That's unfortunate. It is.

401
00:20:51,434 --> 00:20:52,434
Sorry about that.

402
00:20:56,294 --> 00:20:57,941
Please don't leave me again.

403
00:20:58,194 --> 00:20:59,374
It's too dangerous.

404
00:21:00,054 --> 00:21:03,414
Take your eyes off me for
even a moment and I might die.

405
00:21:04,034 --> 00:21:04,914
Very true.

406
00:21:05,714 --> 00:21:07,890
Was that a marriage proposal I heard?

407
00:21:09,654 --> 00:21:11,054
Village head! No!

408
00:21:11,354 --> 00:21:13,291
Village head! I said no!

409
00:21:13,374 --> 00:21:15,531
Please, we desperately need your guidance!

410
00:21:15,614 --> 00:21:16,444
Fine!

411
00:21:16,527 --> 00:21:17,357
Stop chasing me!

412
00:21:17,714 --> 00:21:19,034
When did you get here?

413
00:21:21,494 --> 00:21:22,324
No...

414
00:21:22,634 --> 00:21:23,814
They ate it! What?

415
00:21:24,014 --> 00:21:27,190
The smell is making my mouth
water even this far away.

416
00:21:27,594 --> 00:21:28,934
Let's go try some.

417
00:21:29,994 --> 00:21:32,091
You can make do with
the dried squid we have.

418
00:21:32,174 --> 00:21:36,551
You know, when those two showed up, I had
a suspicion they'd upend our plan somehow.

419
00:21:36,634 --> 00:21:38,575
And yet they surprised me anyway.

420
00:21:39,474 --> 00:21:40,304
Hmph.

421
00:21:41,134 --> 00:21:43,191
There's no way we'd beat Four-Eyes.

422
00:21:43,274 --> 00:21:45,334
He was able to defeat me after all.

423
00:21:46,294 --> 00:21:47,991
Why are you bragging about that?

424
00:21:48,074 --> 00:21:51,780
In any case, we finished our
business here, so we should leave.

425
00:21:52,474 --> 00:21:53,304
Understood.

426
00:21:53,387 --> 00:21:56,427
At least we can bring back
some squid for the demon lord.

427
00:21:57,374 --> 00:22:00,071
So his strength decreases
when they become separated.

428
00:22:00,154 --> 00:22:00,984
Huh.

429
00:22:02,254 --> 00:22:04,474
That gives me a delicious idea.

430
00:22:21,094 --> 00:22:24,434
It's a man, it's a man.

431
00:22:26,554 --> 00:22:27,534
It's a man.

432
00:22:29,134 --> 00:22:30,294
Let's go.

433
00:22:32,414 --> 00:22:33,671
Let's go.

434
00:22:33,754 --> 00:22:36,011
Let's go. Let's go. Yeah! It's a man.

435
00:22:36,094 --> 00:22:38,371
You'll have to say it.

436
00:22:38,454 --> 00:22:40,891
I'm happy.

437
00:22:40,974 --> 00:22:42,411
You're satisfied.

438
00:22:42,494 --> 00:22:45,414
You can't stop.

439
00:22:53,594 --> 00:22:55,111
Thank you

440
00:22:55,194 --> 00:23:02,194
so

441
00:23:13,674 --> 00:23:14,774
much.

442
00:23:36,314 --> 00:23:38,494
So what was your end goal, really?

443
00:23:38,754 --> 00:23:41,251
I just wanted to squeeze
a cute girl, is all.

444
00:23:41,334 --> 00:23:44,371
And now you understand that's super not
cool and the reason you got punished?

445
00:23:44,454 --> 00:23:45,284
Yes.

446
00:23:45,367 --> 00:23:46,711
So have you learned your lesson?

447
00:23:46,794 --> 00:23:49,088
I didn't know there was any squid left.

448
00:23:49,214 --> 00:23:50,534
You're so good.
